uction consumers; for unavailable downstream surfaces inspect the explicit precise ownership handoff, its actual API/consumer obligations and recorded boundaries. Do not claim a path list/local walk proves replication. Preserve RPC transport/handshake/watchdog boundary and full assigned credentials scope.\\nRe-derive the21-row AC matrix including coherent reader row13, and check all five CR3 findings. Retain valid earlier evidence with explicit bounds; do not rerun unrelated batteries without cause. Verify newly affected final-source mutation plants have named behavioral failures and applied harmless survivors; config explicit-label kill is label precision, not semantic narrowing. Full required local checks may be reused with exact current provenance, never override new failing counterexamples. All CI local. Curator Go testing skill required. Attach exact verdict and reproducible evidence, use live merged checklist and normal reviewer lifecycle. No product edits/commits/integration/landing. Codex gpt-6-astra medium; /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board.\\n\\n===== TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-after-rev3-current.md =====\\nIndependently review the next immutable credentials/Config4 CR published after rework RUN-260910-869a2b. Read CR3 verdict and evidence, current task scope/AC, producer outcome and exact current CR base/tree. Retain the refreshed v060 adoption and preserved SSH/peer/RPC boundaries. This brief is for a newly published candidate only; do not review or mutate the live producer worktree.\\nReproduce the CR3 production counterexamples on immutable new bytes: TestReviewerStaleMutation, TestReviewerRevocationDuringBoundary, TestReviewerCrashBetweenConfigAndGeneration. Verify stale original mutation binding refuses before any callback, deterministic same-Store and separate-Store/process serialization (not scheduling-dependent immediate selects), and durable coherent config/trust reader selection across real child-process apply/rollback crash and restart.